{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rivals Hover League Demo (July 25 ~ 28)</strong> \u2013 Add to your wishlist now and be the first to get the latest updates!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/e3d1156cdb1186ded78b8fb5834c015b.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/e3d1156cdb1186ded78b8fb5834c015b.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/e3d1156cdb1186ded78b8fb5834c015b.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/4d5e533fd0cfd3d14b90664a3c188c13.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The galaxy\u2019s wildest competition is looking for new Pilots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be one of the first to test your skills in the <i>Rivals Hover League</i> demo \u2014 where hover, boost, and tactical firepower collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25b6 About the Demo \u25c0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo version of <i>Rivals Hover League</i> includes only a portion of the final content, it represents the heart of RHL\u2019s fast, skill-driven, and tactical gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is still under active development, thus some systems and features are missing or unpolished, and bugs may occur during gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re inviting early pilots not only to play\u2014but to shape the league. Feedback from this demo will directly inform how we evolve the game heading into full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2705What to Expect in the Demo \u2705</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Play three action-packed multiplayer modes</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rivals Mode \u2013 eliminate rivals to win. Only one life, and no second chances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Core Battle \u2013 Secure the fusion core and bear the tradeoffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team Deathmatch \u2013 Classic kill-count mayhem.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes a curated selection of arena maps tailored to each mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Unique Hover Vehicles</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 7 unique hover rigs, each built for a distinct combat role. Every vehicle comes with its own feel, abilities, and ultimates. Pick the one that fits your style and define your way in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>4v4 Competitive Matches</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join intense 4v4 team battles or solo queue for quick matches. Whether you play with friends or go solo, you\u2019ll drop into fast, coordinated fights in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Progression &amp; Unlockables</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete matches and daily missions to level up your account and unlock hover vehicles and cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Demo Participation Rewards</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players who participate in this demo will be eligible to unlock exclusive rewards enjoyable in Rivals Hover League once the full version launches.<br>These rewards will not be granted immediately upon demo play but will be distributed later as part of official launch events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25b6 Please note</strong>: All demo data \u2014 including progress, levels, and unlocks \u2014 will be wiped after the demo ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These will not carry over into the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for being part of the rivalry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re building the League \u2014 one hover at a time \u2014 with your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/f682ec5374a1d182e5b88800a0398b1b.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/77a999cd8ca189754e27d227799ff67d.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast. Fierce. Frictionless.<br>Step into Rivals Hover League, the official vehicular combat sport spreading across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a pilot, you\u2019ll take control of a hover vehicle, dominate the arena, grow with your team, and rise to legend.<br>Outplay your rival \u2014 Hover, Boost, Shoot Your Way to MVP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/9ca13b177f8f428dfb2ac58091062368.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget the ground. Out here, motion never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your hover as it glides, drifts, and blasts through the arena with gravity-defying boosts, high-flying jumps, and precision braking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every vehicle feels like a real machine with weight, friction, and impact you can feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every shot, every turn, every second. It all starts at your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/568f59a95bd7e3a5f1faf6007fd7366a.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form a squad of up to four and enter the league.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can hover alone, but victory? That takes teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordinate with your crew, lock onto your rivals, and push through the chaos together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hover the arena together. Make the win yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/63e97a3cc96996b30bffa6c1154189d8.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slice through rivals with speed,<br>shield your team with brute force,<br>or disrupt the field with tactical tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from unique hover classes, each designed with its own edge in combat.<br>The right Hover in the right hands? That\u2019s your competitive edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/1db2bd0dbfe0e7480ae9b8a5c9d8a68c.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rivals Hover League isn\u2019t built for just one way to win.<br>Each match brings different rules, objectives, and arenas. With them, new strategies and shifting team dynamics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt fast, play smart, and turn every game into your own kind of victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/5ee0403f364be5dbd686a90c858c05f3.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/5ee0403f364be5dbd686a90c858c05f3.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/5ee0403f364be5dbd686a90c858c05f3.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/97243dd545b89363dc94188e0251c307.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist now and hop into our official Discord!<br>Chat with the devs, clash in pilot tournaments, and help shape the future of RHL, together with the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're building RHL <i>with</i> you, one hover at a time!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3779620?t=1752826127","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3779620?t=1752826127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/fe036768d8fb43770ec474011fdb063f972f4aa7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752826127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/fe036768d8fb43770ec474011fdb063f972f4aa7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752826127","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rivals Hover League Demo (July 25 ~ 28)</strong> \u2013 Add to your wishlist now and be the first to get the latest updates!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/e3d1156cdb1186ded78b8fb5834c015b.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/e3d1156cdb1186ded78b8fb5834c015b.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/e3d1156cdb1186ded78b8fb5834c015b.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/4d5e533fd0cfd3d14b90664a3c188c13.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The galaxy\u2019s wildest competition is looking for new Pilots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be one of the first to test your skills in the <i>Rivals Hover League</i> demo \u2014 where hover, boost, and tactical firepower collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25b6 About the Demo \u25c0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo version of <i>Rivals Hover League</i> includes only a portion of the final content, it represents the heart of RHL\u2019s fast, skill-driven, and tactical gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is still under active development, thus some systems and features are missing or unpolished, and bugs may occur during gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re inviting early pilots not only to play\u2014but to shape the league. Feedback from this demo will directly inform how we evolve the game heading into full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2705What to Expect in the Demo \u2705</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Play three action-packed multiplayer modes</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rivals Mode \u2013 eliminate rivals to win. Only one life, and no second chances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Core Battle \u2013 Secure the fusion core and bear the tradeoffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team Deathmatch \u2013 Classic kill-count mayhem.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes a curated selection of arena maps tailored to each mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Unique Hover Vehicles</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 7 unique hover rigs, each built for a distinct combat role. Every vehicle comes with its own feel, abilities, and ultimates. Pick the one that fits your style and define your way in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>4v4 Competitive Matches</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join intense 4v4 team battles or solo queue for quick matches. Whether you play with friends or go solo, you\u2019ll drop into fast, coordinated fights in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Progression &amp; Unlockables</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete matches and daily missions to level up your account and unlock hover vehicles and cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Demo Participation Rewards</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players who participate in this demo will be eligible to unlock exclusive rewards enjoyable in Rivals Hover League once the full version launches.<br>These rewards will not be granted immediately upon demo play but will be distributed later as part of official launch events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25b6 Please note</strong>: All demo data \u2014 including progress, levels, and unlocks \u2014 will be wiped after the demo ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These will not carry over into the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for being part of the rivalry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re building the League \u2014 one hover at a time \u2014 with your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/f682ec5374a1d182e5b88800a0398b1b.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/4851db25bce57c97e00ed5c5a98c0ef9.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/77a999cd8ca189754e27d227799ff67d.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast. Fierce. Frictionless.<br>Step into Rivals Hover League, the official vehicular combat sport spreading across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a pilot, you\u2019ll take control of a hover vehicle, dominate the arena, grow with your team, and rise to legend.<br>Outplay your rival \u2014 Hover, Boost, Shoot Your Way to MVP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/daf78b6a0c85540a481699cbd3528da2.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/9ca13b177f8f428dfb2ac58091062368.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget the ground. Out here, motion never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your hover as it glides, drifts, and blasts through the arena with gravity-defying boosts, high-flying jumps, and precision braking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every vehicle feels like a real machine with weight, friction, and impact you can feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every shot, every turn, every second. It all starts at your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/d39e301b9d05a322c122be65df7e77ba.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/568f59a95bd7e3a5f1faf6007fd7366a.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form a squad of up to four and enter the league.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can hover alone, but victory? That takes teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordinate with your crew, lock onto your rivals, and push through the chaos together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hover the arena together. Make the win yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/048224fdbd1cb95ce5e674263d6bdc5d.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/63e97a3cc96996b30bffa6c1154189d8.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slice through rivals with speed,<br>shield your team with brute force,<br>or disrupt the field with tactical tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from unique hover classes, each designed with its own edge in combat.<br>The right Hover in the right hands? That\u2019s your competitive edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/1919109490047b42e37faa4c0544c549.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/1db2bd0dbfe0e7480ae9b8a5c9d8a68c.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rivals Hover League isn\u2019t built for just one way to win.<br>Each match brings different rules, objectives, and arenas. With them, new strategies and shifting team dynamics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt fast, play smart, and turn every game into your own kind of victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/5ee0403f364be5dbd686a90c858c05f3.poster.avif?t=1752826127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/5ee0403f364be5dbd686a90c858c05f3.webm?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/5ee0403f364be5dbd686a90c858c05f3.mp4?t=1752826127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/extras/97243dd545b89363dc94188e0251c307.avif?t=1752826127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist now and hop into our official Discord!<br>Chat with the devs, clash in pilot tournaments, and help shape the future of RHL, together with the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're building RHL <i>with</i> you, one hover at a time!</p>","developers":["EF Games"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Krafton ID (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","fullgame":{"appid":"3251280","name":"Rivals Hover League"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779620/cfbfdd9960febba750ac79045c19659bb658ace1/header.jpg?t=1752826127","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 EF Games. RIVALS HOVER LEAGUE IS A TRADEMARK OR SERVICE MARK OF KRAFTON, INC.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257168517,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168517/movie480.mp4?t=1752800425","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168517/movie_max.mp4?t=1752800425"},"name":"Rivals Hover League Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257168517/2a7a995b0899821b121e817ffb70d2a6ce232bcf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752800425","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168517/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752800425","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168517/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752800425"}}],"name":"Rivals Hover League Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u